  "behavior_changes": [
    "Author-selected paper-default batch, schedules, caps and thinking flags in the short launchers; recorded settings retained separately.",
    "External extra forward KL now gates on entire all-wrong reward groups; complete local groups required. Original clipped core/residual unchanged.",
    "Retired unconditional nonzero-mu path disabled in self-distillation; math all-wrong wrapper remains available.",
    "Math evaluator prompt style is explicit, and temperature-0.6 results are labelled correctly without changing source sampling.",
    "MultiPL-E generation accepts sampled n/temperature/seed options, retaining its original greedy default.",
    "Docker execution uses the verified original image repository digest instead of a host-local image ID.",
    "Dataset preparation refuses to overwrite a frozen output."
  ]
